# Built output — regenerated on every publish from the spec + source.
dist/

# We DO commit src/generated/api.ts:
#   • Code review surfaces type changes when the spec changes.
#   • Type-check works on a fresh checkout without running the generator.
#   • Editor IntelliSense works immediately.
# It's overwritten by `npm run generate:types` (a `prebuild` step) before
# every build, so drift is impossible.
